# Dalben: a cluster of three tarred mooring piles (d with an l lit
# stripe) with pointed O/l conical caps (never flat: not a platform,
# D-038), lashed with two o/O rope bands, k outline above the water. The
# water line is sprite row 32: below it the piles continue one tile as a
# T/d tint (no outline), with w ripples at the line. Front-layer prop.
# Origin 8,32 (catalog said 8,48): placed in the air cell above the
# surface, its origin sits on the water line, so the bottom tile reaches
# under the surface.
# Drawn by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid is the source.
sprite = dalben
size   = 16x48
origin = 8,32
anim   = idle frames=1
